# Manifest of the gd test suites pcb/scripts/run-gd-tests.sh MUST find under
# pcb/tests/gd/. One filename per line, exactly as it appears on disk.
#
# This file is deliberately NOT named test_*.gd (it must not match the
# runner's own `test_*.gd` glob) and NOT executable GDScript — it exists
# purely so a suite going missing (deleted, renamed, moved off the glob) is a
# loud, named pre-flight failure instead of a silently smaller passing run.
# See docket item 019fa83e8310 / pcb/docs/gd-tests.md.
#
# Adding a suite is a deliberate two-step edit: add the test_*.gd file, AND
# add its name here. The runner fails pre-flight in both directions:
#   - an entry here with no corresponding file on disk (deletion/rename), and
#   - a test_*.gd file on disk with no entry here (addition without
#     registration).
# Lines starting with '#' and blank lines are ignored.
